{
  "info": {
    "name": "Content Management API",
    "description": "Test collection for the Content Management service. Covers the ingestion webhook (Organization Basic auth), the read-only entities API (User/Admin Basic auth), the admin disable endpoint, and a Scenarios folder of ordered, self-verifying request sequences (corner case, out-of-order, multi-version, batch, delete, disable, unpublish).\n\nImport the companion environment file `Content.Management.postman_environment.json` and select it as the active environment. All credentials, base URL, and entity id are read from environment variables:\n- baseUrl, entityId\n- orgUsername, orgPassword\n- userUsername, userPassword\n- adminUsername, adminPassword\n\nRun the Scenarios folder with the Runner (top-to-bottom); each request asserts the expected status and outcome.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
